WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
No feet or hands needed

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Yes, I just gave you the simplest way

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
You are disgusted, now you can solve it yourself

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
You are making it more difficult on purpose

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Yes, who told you to talk nonsense?

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Also, whoever finishes last will be responsible for packing up the four jars

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,150
Now I can't lose even more

8
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:18,150
Why is there no movement at all?

9
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:20,150
Don't worry about it, since Su Ce separated the work

10
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:21,150
Just make our own

11
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:23,150
And he said it depends on the workload

12
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:24,150
Don't be slow to chat

13
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:26,150
When the time comes, we will really miss you and you will suffer.

14
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:30,100
What are you doing?

15
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,100
Don't know

16
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:33,100
But it sounds much livelier than Ge Yang

17
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:40,470
Don’t touch the grapes with your hands or step on them with your feet

18
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:41,470
Does it count?

19
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:42,470
Forget it, continue

20
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:43,470
That's okay too

21
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:45,470
The rules only say you can't use your hands directly
